"cek": "<div class=\"border-b border-garis bg-biru-muda/60\"><div class=\"wadah py-12 md:py-16\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-balance md:text-4xl\">Cek Status Pendaftaran</h1><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-samar\">Masukkan nomor registrasi dan tanggal lahir yang Anda gunakan saat mendaftar. Keduanya diperlukan agar data pribadi tidak dapat dibuka oleh orang lain.</p></div></div><div class=\"wadah py-12\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"space-y-8\"><form class=\"kartu p-6 md:p-7\" novalidate=\"\"><div class=\"space-y-5\"><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div><label for=\"no_registrasi\" class=\"mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold text-teks\">Nomor registrasi<span class=\"ml-0.5 text-red-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"no_registrasi\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"PPDB-2728-0001\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border bg-white px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[15px] text-teks placeholder:text-samar/70 transition focus:border-biru focus:ring-2 focus:ring-biru/20 disabled:bg-slate-50 disabled:text-samar border-garis\" name=\"no_registrasi\" value=\"\"><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-samar\">Nomor yang Anda terima setelah mengirim formulir.</p></div><div><label for=\"tanggal_lahir\" class=\"mb-1.5 block text-sm font-semibold text-teks\">Tanggal lahir<span class=\"ml-0.5 text-red-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"tanggal_lahir\" type=\"date\" class=\"w-full rounded-lg border bg-white px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[15px] text-teks placeholder:text-samar/70 transition focus:border-biru focus:ring-2 focus:ring-biru/20 disabled:bg-slate-50 disabled:text-samar border-garis\" name=\"tanggal_lahir\" value=\"\"><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-samar\">Dipakai sebagai pengaman agar data Anda tidak terbuka oleh orang lain.</p></div></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60 bg-biru text-white hover:bg-biru-tua\">Lihat Status</button></div></form></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$-->",
"cekHasil": "<div class=\"kartu overflow-hidden\" ><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-garis bg-biru-muda px-6 py-5\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-samar uppercase\">Nomor registrasi</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-2xl font-bold text-biru-tua\">PPDB-2728-0002</p></div><span class=\"inline-block rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold bg-green-100 text-green-800 border-green-200\">Diterima</span></div><dl class=\"divide-y divide-garis text-sm\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 px-6 py-3.5 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:gap-4\"><dt class=\"text-samar\">Nama lengkap</dt><dd class=\"font-semibold text-teks sm:text-right\">Ahmad Fauzi Rizaldi</dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 px-6 py-3.5 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:gap-4\"><dt class=\"text-samar\">Tahun ajaran</dt><dd class=\"font-semibold text-teks sm:text-right\">2027/2028</dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 px-6 py-3.5 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:gap-4\"><dt class=\"text-samar\">Jalur pendaftaran</dt><dd class=\"font-semibold text-teks sm:text-right\">Prestasi</dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 px-6 py-3.5 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:gap-4\"><dt class=\"text-samar\">Peminatan</dt><dd class=\"font-semibold text-teks sm:text-right\">Peminatan MIPA</dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 px-6 py-3.5 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:gap-4\"><dt class=\"text-samar\">Waktu mendaftar</dt><dd class=\"font-semibold text-teks sm:text-right\">22 September 2026, 22.06</dd></div></dl><div class=\"space-y-4 border-t border-garis px-6 py-5\"><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-teks\">Selamat, Anda dinyatakan diterima. Lanjutkan dengan daftar ulang sesuai ketentuan sekolah.</p><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-biru/20 bg-biru-muda px-5 py-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-biru uppercase\">Catatan panitia</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line text-teks\">Nilai dan sertifikat prestasi memenuhi syarat jalur Prestasi. Silakan daftar ulang paling lambat 12 Juli 2027.</p></div><p class=\"text-sm text-samar\">Pengumuman hasil seleksi dijadwalkan pada <strong class=\"text-biru-tua\">5 Juli 2027</strong>.</p><div class=\"tanpa-cetak space-y-3 border-t border-garis pt-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60 bg-biru text-white hover:bg-biru-tua\">Unduh Bukti Pendaftaran (PDF)</button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60 border border-garis bg-white text-teks hover:bg-biru-muda hover:text-biru\">Cetak halaman ini</button></div><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-samar\">Bukti pendaftaran dirakit di server, jadi bentuknya sama di semua peramban. Berkasnya memuat data pribadi, simpan di tempat yang aman.</p></div></div></div>",
